## Interface: 16001
## Title: Priority Rotation (DaylightUI Plugin)
## Notes: One-button rotation for WoW: Forever: step through a spell list you build, one key press at a time. Also hides chosen error messages and game sounds, and equips upgrades. Needs DaylightUI.
